### substitution output sent to a file
result=$(compute > out.txt)
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2327 1:8
>>> SC2328 1:18

### backtick substitution with fd 1 redirected
result=`compute 1> out.txt`
>>> SC2006 1:8
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2327 1:8
>>> SC2328 1:17

### brace substitution appending to a file
result=${ compute >> out.txt; }
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2327 1:8
>>> SC2328 1:19

### last stage of a pipeline redirected
result=$(compute | sort > sorted.txt)
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2327 1:8
>>> SC2328 1:25

### unnumbered duplication to another fd
result=$(compute >&3)
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2327 1:8
>>> SC2328 1:18

### stderr captured then stdout discarded
errors=$(compute 2>&1 > /dev/null)
>>> SC2034 1:1

### two statements second redirected
result=$(prepare; compute > out.txt)
>>> SC2034 1:1

### two statements first redirected
result=$(prepare > prep.log; compute)
>>> SC2034 1:1

### reading from a duplicated fd
saved=$(cat <&3)
>>> SC2034 1:1
